        "created_at": "2016-06-08T14:14:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was facing against the Matriarch in Time Cataclysm; she had two Carrion Fields and her Mask out, and. Not the greatest scenario, then came the Surprise Shopping Trip.</p><p>The ONLY reason I survived was Sky-Scraper's Towering Monolith (?) &nbsp;making her take 0 damage. She killed her own Domains and Mask, but it's a very nasty combination that can wipe out any team fairly easily. Damage reduction and redirection, what a saviour.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:47:37.079Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
