        "raw": "<p>I was facing against the Matriarch in Time Cataclysm; she had two Carrion Fields and her Mask out, and. Not the greatest scenario, then came the Surprise Shopping Trip.</p><p>The ONLY reason I survived was Sky-Scraper&#39;s Towering Monolith (?) &nbsp;making her take 0 damage. She killed her own Domains and Mask, but it&#39;s a very nasty combination that can wipe out any team fairly easily. Damage reduction and redirection, what a saviour.&nbsp;</p>",
